
### Readd All users (req to protected route)
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/users


### Read user by id
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/user



### user login  
// leave a line after content type if not you will get an err header name must be valid
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/auth
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "email":"nanda@gmail.com",
    "password":"nanda"
} 

### Create new user
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"nanda",
    "password":"nanda",
    "email":"nanda@gmail.com",
    "age":24
}

###Update the existing user
PUT  http://localhost:4000/user-api/users/69ad04f67b125ae35bc862b7
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"bhanukumar",
    "password":"bhanuprasad",
    "email":"bhanuprasad@gmial.com",
    "age":24
}


### Delete the existing user
DELETE http://localhost:4000/user-api/users/69ad04f67b125ae35bc862b7  

### add product to user req 
PUT http://localhost:4000/user-api/cart/product-id/69ad117135eb5ea9477ad543

















